        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown phone dictates your every step. A faceless voice commands you to collect hidden chips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you obey without question… or will you discover too late who is truly pulling the STRINGS?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905520/extras/98a21079faf6997929967cf490a0dcaa.avif?t=1778181655\" width=970 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Meisin, an ordinary person trapped in a routine without obstacles… until a strange phone intrudes upon your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The instructions are clear: find and deliver the mysterious chips. What seems like a simple task soon spirals into secrets, tension, and choices that will define your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring the call is not an option. And the further you go, the more obvious it becomes that nothing is as it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down horror action adventure in pixel art, where each level challenges you with unique twists:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving mechanics in every chapter: one moment you’re exploring dark corridors, the next you’re controlling an RC car or a drone to overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings within each level: most paths lead to unexpected detours… but only one continues the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking cutscenes that gradually uncover the truth behind the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905520/extras/cd09238f8c0add4a8385bd8afb6744fe.avif?t=1778181655\" width=970 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W, A, S, D → Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E → Act / Pick up / Interact</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious and tense narrative, where every step could be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art-inspired visuals, blending retro charm with unsettling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique levels, each with its own mechanics, mood, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted cutscenes that drive the story and deepen immersion.</p>",
